</a><a href=https://x.com/ondbai class=nav-social-link aria-label="X (Twitter)" target=_blank rel=noopener><svg viewBox="0 0 20 18" width="20" height="18" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8.71 9.38 3.35 15.5H.37L7.33 7.56 8.71 9.38zm1.62-5.76L15.25-2h2.96l-6.5 7.44-1.38-1.82zM19.36 17.5H13.37L0 0H6.11L19.36 17.5zm-5.17-1.78h1.65L5.23 1.68H3.46L14.19 15.72z" transform="translate(0 0.5)"/></svg></a></div><a href=/#get-started class="btn btn-ghost btn-nav"><span>Get started</span>
<svg viewBox="0 0 8 10" width="8" height="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 1 5 5 1 9"/></svg></a></div></div></nav><main><section class=hero data-mode=data><div class=hero-dots aria-hidden=true></div><div class=hero-dots-accent aria-hidden=true></div><div class=container><div class=hero-content><h1 class=hero-headline id=hero-headline>Your data is being used. <em>Get paid for it.</em></h1><p class=hero-sub id=hero-sub>Turn APIs and databases into paid endpoints for AI agents.<br>OnDB handles payments, routing, and settlement.</p><div class=hero-ctas><a href=https://docs.ondb.ai/ class="hero-btn hero-btn-primary" target=_blank rel=noopener>Read Docs
<svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 5l5 5-5 5"/></svg>
</a><a href=#get-started class="hero-btn hero-btn-ghost">Get early access
<svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 5l5 5-5 5"/></svg></a></div></div><div class=hero-mode-toggle role=tablist aria-label="View mode"><button type=button class="hero-mode-btn is-active" data-mode=data role=tab aria-selected=true aria-label="Data provider">
