</button>
<button type=button class=hero-mode-btn data-mode=app role=tab aria-selected=false aria-label=App>
<svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.5 13.5l3-3.5-3-3.5m-7 0-3 3.5 3 3.5m5-10-3 13"/></svg></button></div><div class=hero-dashboard><div id=hero-lottie data-src=/images/hero1.json></div><noscript><img src=/images/hero-data-screenshot.webp alt="OnDB data provider dashboard" width=1440 height=624></noscript></div></div></section><section class=trusted-by data-animate><div class="container trusted-by-inner"><span class=trusted-by-label>Trusted by</span><div class=trusted-by-logos><a href=https://www.greynoise.io/ target=_blank rel=noopener><img src=/images/partners/greynoise-logo.svg alt=GreyNoise></a>
<a href=https://fullhunt.io/ target=_blank rel=noopener><img src=/images/partners/fullhunt-logo.png alt=FullHunt></a>
<a href=https://celestia.org/ target=_blank rel=noopener><img src=/images/partners/celestia.svg alt=Celestia></a></div></div></section><section class=intro data-animate><div class=container><span class=intro-kicker><span class=intro-kicker-icon aria-hidden=true><img src=/images/logo.svg alt width=20 height=20>
</span>How it Works</span><h2>AI agents are your new users. OnDB makes sure you get paid.</h2><p>The next trillion queries won't come from humans clicking buttons — they'll come from agents running pipelines. OnDB puts your data in the path of that traffic, with payments wired in from the start.</p><div class=hiw-cards data-animate=stagger><div class=hiw-card><div class=hiw-card-visual data-lottie=/images/card1.json role=img aria-label=Connect style=background-image:url(/images/hiw-card-1.webp)></div><h3>Connect</h3><p>Bring your APIs, databases, or hosted datasets. Any data source, any shape.</p></div><div class=hiw-card><div class=hiw-card-visual data-lottie=/images/card2.json role=img aria-label=Expose style=background-image:url(/images/hiw-card-2.webp)></div><h3>Expose</h3><p>Publish queryable endpoints via the OnDB gateway. Set access rules and pricing in code.</p></div><div class=hiw-card><div class=hiw-card-visual data-lottie=/images/card3.json role=img aria-label=Monetize style=background-image:url(/images/hiw-card-3.webp)></div><h3>Monetize</h3><p>Highlights content that fully resolves the query, prioritizing completeness and direct usefulness.</p></div></div><div style=margin-top:48px><a href=/#get-started class="btn btn-primary btn-auto">Get early access
<svg viewBox="0 0 8 10" width="8" height="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 1 5 5 1 9"/></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=one-layer id=features data-animate><div class=container><div class=section-header style=text-align:center><span class=intro-kicker><span class=intro-kicker-icon aria-hidden=true><img src=/images/logo.svg alt width=20 height=20>
</span>Core Features</span><h2>Everything runs on one layer.</h2><p>Query data, apply pricing, and handle payments in a single system. No extra infrastructure, no fragmented stack.</p></div><div class=ol-grid data-animate=stagger><article class="ol-card ol-card-white ol-card-wide"><h3>Unified Query Layer</h3><p>Query across multiple data sources as a single system. Join, compose, and create new endpoints without stitching APIs.</p><img class=ol-card-visual src=/images/ol-card-1.webp alt width=832 height=368 loading=lazy decoding=async></article><article class="ol-card ol-card-blue"><h3>Dynamic Pricing</h3><p>Charge based on the data requested, not flat API calls. Pricing reflects real usage.</p><img class=ol-card-visual src=/images/ol-card-2.webp alt width=504 height=368 loading=lazy decoding=async></article><article class="ol-card ol-card-blue"><h3>Built-in Payments</h3><p>Every query is priced and settled automatically. No billing infrastructure required.</p><img class=ol-card-visual src=/images/ol-card-3.webp alt width=504 height=368 loading=lazy decoding=async></article><article class="ol-card ol-card-white ol-card-wide"><h3>Data-Source Agnostic</h3><p>Works with APIs, databases, or hosted data. Plug into your existing stack with no migration.</p><img class=ol-card-visual src=/images/ol-card-4.webp alt width=832 height=368 loading=lazy decoding=async></article></div></div></section><section class=audiences id=audiences data-animate><div class=container><div class=audiences-top><div class=audiences-header><span class=intro-kicker><span class=intro-kicker-icon aria-hidden=true><img src=/images/logo.svg alt width=20 height=20>
</span>Use Cases</span><h2>Built for every side of the data economy</h2><p>Turn data into revenue, power intelligent agents, and build apps on top of a monetized data layer.</p></div></div><div class=audiences-cards data-animate=stagger><div class=audiences-card><img src=/images/use-cases/container-agent.webp alt="AI Developers" width=550 height=450 loading=lazy decoding=async><h3>AI Developers</h3><p>Access structured, paid data across providers through a single query layer.</p></div><div class=audiences-card><img src=/images/use-cases/container-api.webp alt="API Platforms" width=550 height=450 loading=lazy decoding=async><h3>API Platforms</h3><p>Move beyond flat pricing. Charge per query based on real data usage.</p></div><div class=audiences-card><img src=/images/use-cases/container-data-rich.webp alt="Data-rich SaaS" width=550 height=450 loading=lazy decoding=async><h3>Data-rich SaaS</h3><p>Turn internal data into a new revenue stream, without changing your core product.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=comparison id=compare data-animate><div class=container><div class=section-header style=text-align:center><span class=intro-kicker><span class=intro-kicker-icon aria-hidden=true><img src=/images/logo.svg alt width=20 height=20>
</span>Compare</span><h2>Scrapers are a revenue problem, not a security problem</h2><p>Platforms spend millions blocking bots. But AI agents aren't going away, they're the new API consumers. Sell to them instead.</p></div><div class=compare-table role=table aria-label="Comparison of approaches to AI traffic"><div class="compare-cell compare-head"></div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Ignore AI Traffic</div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Block & fight</div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Traditional APIs</div><div class="compare-cell compare-head good"><img src=/images/logo-full.svg alt=OnDB class=compare-ondb-logo></div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Revenue from AI traffic</div><div class=compare-cell>No revenue</div><div class=compare-cell>Lost to scraping</div><div class=compare-cell>Fixed plans, low adoption</div><div class="compare-cell good"><span class=ico-check>✓</span>Automatic per-query</div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Agent discovery</div><div class=compare-cell>None</div><div class=compare-cell>Invisible to agents</div><div class=compare-cell>Manual integration</div><div class="compare-cell good"><span class=ico-check>✓</span>Auto via skills.md</div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Cross-provider joins</div><div class=compare-cell>Not possible</div><div class=compare-cell>Not possible</div><div class=compare-cell>Custom glue code</div><div class="compare-cell good"><span class=ico-check>✓</span>Built-in</div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Revenue sharing</div><div class=compare-cell>None</div><div class=compare-cell>None</div><div class=compare-cell>Manual contracts</div><div class="compare-cell good"><span class=ico-check>✓</span>Automatic splits</div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Data migration required</div><div class=compare-cell>Not applicable</div><div class=compare-cell>Not applicable</div><div class=compare-cell>ETL and duplication</div><div class="compare-cell good"><span class=ico-check>✓</span>Zero, connect in place</div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Time to revenue</div><div class=compare-cell>Never</div><div class=compare-cell>Never</div><div class=compare-cell>Months</div><div class="compare-cell good"><span class=ico-check>✓</span>Revenue in Minutes</div><div class="compare-cell compare-head">Scales with agent economy</div><div class=compare-cell>No</div><div class=compare-cell>No</div><div class=compare-cell>Limited</div><div class="compare-cell good"><span class=ico-check>✓</span>Grows with usage</div></div></div></section><section class=data-economy data-animate><div class=container><div class=section-header><h2>Powering the data economy</h2><p>Query data, apply pricing, and handle payments in a single system. No extra infrastructure, no fragmented stack.</p></div><div class=data-economy-stats><div class=stat><div class=v>HTTP 402</div><div class=k>Native payment protocol</div></div><div class=stat><div class=v>Any source</div><div class=k>REST, GraphQL, SQL, NoSQL</div></div><div class=stat><div class=v>Auto split</div><div class=k>Server-side revenue share</div></div><div class=stat><div class=v>0ms</div><div class=k>Migration required</div></div></div><div class=data-economy-illustration aria-hidden=true><img src=/images/ellipse.svg alt></div></div></section><section class=faq data-animate><div class=container><div class=section-header><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=faq-list><details class=faq-item><summary>What kind of data can I publish?</summary><div class=faq-answer>Any REST or GraphQL API, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Supabase, ClickHouse, or hosted dataset. If it has a schema, it works — the OnDB connector wraps it into a queryable endpoint.</div></details><details class=faq-item><summary>How do payments work?</summary><div class=faq-answer>OnDB implements HTTP 402 natively. Every request is priced per query and settled automatically via x402 or Machine Payments Protocol (MPP) — no billing logic or reconciliation on your end.</div></details><details class=faq-item><summary>How does revenue sharing work?</summary><div class=faq-answer>You set your per-query price in code. OnDB meters usage, splits revenue between providers and the platform automatically, and pays out to your wallet. Share ratios are configured server-side.</div></details><details class=faq-item><summary>How do AI agents discover my data?</summary><div class=faq-answer>Agents read a standardized <code>skills.md</code> definition exposed by your OnDB endpoint. No marketplace listing — just publish, and any agent that speaks the protocol can find, query, and pay for your data.</div></details><details class=faq-item><summary>How is this different from other AI tools?</summary><div class=faq-answer>Most tools help agents generate output. OnDB is the infrastructure between agents and the data they need — a payment-native query layer that routes across providers and settles in real time.</div></details><details class=faq-item><summary>Does my data leave my infrastructure?</summary><div class=faq-answer>No. The OnDB connector runs inside your environment and queries are processed locally — only the query response is returned to the agent. Your databases, APIs, and raw data stay exactly where they are.</div></details><details class=faq-item><summary>How is data secured in transit?</summary><div class=faq-answer>All traffic is TLS 1.3 end-to-end. Payment proofs are signed via x402, and data never leaves your infrastructure — OnDB routes requests to your connector without proxying payloads through a middleman.</div></details></div></div></section><section class=signup id=get-started data-animate><div class=container><div class=signup-inner><span class=intro-kicker><span class=intro-kicker-icon aria-hidden=true><img src=/images/logo.svg alt width=20 height=20>
</span>Early Access</span><h2>Get early access to OnDB.</h2><p>We're onboarding design partners now. Leave your email and we'll reach out with access details.</p><form class=signup-form action=https://app.loops.so/api/newsletter-form/cmkdwzzos034o0i1aq4iq6r6p method=POST><input type=hidden name=userGroup value="Homepage – Early Access"><div class=signup-form-pill><input class=signup-form-input placeholder=you@company.com required type=email name=email aria-label="Email address">
<button type=submit class=signup-form-button>Get Early Access</button></div></form><p class=signup-note>No spam. We'll email you once access is ready.</p></div></div></section></main><footer class=site-footer><div class=container><div class=footer-hero><a href=/ class=footer-brand aria-label="OnDB home"><img src=/images/logo-footer.svg alt=OnDB class=footer-brand-logo></a><h2 class=footer-hero-headline>Query, price, and monetize data in one unified layer.</h2></div><hr class=footer-divider><div class=footer-top><p class=footer-tagline>The missing infrastructure between proprietary data and AI agents.</p><div class=footer-cols><div class=footer-col><span class=footer-col-title>Product</span>
